  "content": "\n\n<p>.我即將推出更大更棒的地圖，今天剛開始製作地圖哈哈。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>.我的第一張地圖並沒有花太多時間，只是剛剛開始做而已&nbsp;幾天後會有一張正式且漂亮的地圖。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這只是一座可以放鬆的生存島，海洋裡還有兩座其他島嶼等你去探索。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; DISCORD 連結</span></strong></h1>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/s4DmXRJe26\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/s4DmXRJe26</a></span></strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;這主要是為了幾週後即將推出的新地圖&nbsp;</span></strong></h3>",
